  dialogue:
  - Dialogue: Anyways...
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31cc8c56635d5ba42b7943fdba18efcd, type: 3}
  - Dialogue: "Look. I know that it must\u2019ve been hard when we were both younger."
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3bf1a18b00c42fa46a3891a38cbfb232, type: 3}
  - Dialogue: Dealing with Grandpa, with my dad, and, well, with me.
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 05bc7261fc317ac44b10debbe34988d4, type: 3}
  - Dialogue: "But I always appreciated it, you know? Even when you would get mad
      at me for being obnoxious, I\u2019m sure."
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d1da91c30447c3f4993c88d7851b5b9f, type: 3}
  - Dialogue: And even when I couldn't hang out as much anymore...
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3bf1a18b00c42fa46a3891a38cbfb232, type: 3}
  - Dialogue: "What I\u2019m trying to say is that you were my first friend. You
      were my best friend for awhile, whether the feeling was mutual or not.  "
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d1da91c30447c3f4993c88d7851b5b9f, type: 3}
  - Dialogue: "If it wasn\u2019t? That\u2019s fine. I\u2019m glad that you were there
      for me at all."
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31cc8c56635d5ba42b7943fdba18efcd, type: 3}
  - Dialogue: "Thank you. We\u2019ll see each other again soon, right?"
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d1da91c30447c3f4993c88d7851b5b9f, type: 3}
